       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-KINETIC-SPINNER.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SPINNER-PROOFS.
           05  WS-MOMENTUM-OK              PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-INERTIA-OK               PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PIVOT-OK                 PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SPINNER-LATENCY-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SPINNER-SEAL-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SPINNER-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-KSP-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-KSP-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-MOMENTUM-AND-INERTIA.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-PIVOT-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-KSP-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-MOMENTUM-AND-INERTIA.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MOMENTUM-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-INERTIA-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-PIVOT-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PIVOT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SPINNER-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-KSP-PROOFS.
           IF WS-MOMENTUM-OK = 1 AND
              WS-INERTIA-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PIVOT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SPINNER-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SPINNER-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-KSP-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-KSP-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-KSP-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-KSP-CODE.
